&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; height=&quot;533&quot; src=&quot;/uploads/images/news/Blog/2025/t9/mercedes-maybach-s680-v12-edition-ma-vang-24k-chi-co-50-chiec-tren-toan-cau/mercedes-maybach-s680-v12-edition.jpg&quot; width=&quot;800&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

