&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; height=&quot;533&quot; src=&quot;/uploads/images/news/Blog/2025/t12/hyundai-staria-2026-ra-mat-chinh-thuc-khai-tu-dong-co-diesel/hyundai-staria-2026.jpg&quot; width=&quot;800&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

