&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&#039;Times New Roman&#039;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:400&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;Khung gạt làm từ nhựa chất lượng cao, nhẹ, bền và chống biến dạng khi sử dụng sau thời gian dài. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

