&lt;h2 style=&quot;font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); margin: 1rem 0px; padding: 0px; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:24px;&quot;&gt;2. So sánh nhanh: Gạt mưa thường với gạt mưa Cleanbro&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;

